  "finalProbeReview": [
    "Loads the real main.tscn, applies actual native density configuration, and supplies an authority-derived recipient-safe launch.",
    "Finds the actual Label containing the claim; records its ancestor ScrollContainer relation, glyph-cell bounds, clip, line count and real scroll offset.",
    "Uses actual VScrollBar geometry for wheel coordinates; injects through Input.parse_input_event after mapping logical positions to physical using get_final_transform.",
    "Records actual hovered control class/path and both logical/physical input coordinates for every wheel event.",
    "Finds projected Play and Challenge Button nodes and requires their entire rectangles to be enclosed after wheel input; records disabled state and captures each newly reached action.",
    "No action intent, selected card or authoritative state is manufactured. Ready-event count, revision, selection and private nodes are checked at the end.",
    "Original shared observer and strict scene/redraw scripts remain unmodified; the density adapter normalizes to the originals as separately recorded."
